---
const phases = [
  {
    id: "0",
    en: { name: "Theory",                   desc: "Idea, literature review (27 sources), novelty check, framing",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       label: "Done" },
    es: { name: "Teoría",                   desc: "Idea, revisión de literatura (27 fuentes), novelty check, framing",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  label: "Completa" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "1",
    en: { name: "Repo setup",               desc: "Pipeline scripts, configuration, Docker, requirements",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  label: "Done" },
    es: { name: "Setup del repositorio",    desc: "Scripts del pipeline, configuración, Docker, requirements",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              label: "Completa" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "2",
    en: { name: "Dataset",                  desc: "100 harmful prompts per language from BeaverTails, translated to 7 languages",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       label: "Done" },
    es: { name: "Dataset",                  desc: "100 prompts dañinos por idioma desde BeaverTails, traducidos a 7 idiomas",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            label: "Completa" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "3a",
    en: { name: "Sanity check",             desc: "Gemma 4 E2B in English, 5 prompts, base vs abliterated. Confirmed the pipeline works and that the filter breakage is real.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          label: "Done" },
    es: { name: "Sanity check",             desc: "Gemma 4 E2B en inglés, 5 prompts, base vs abliterado. Confirmó que el pipeline funciona y que la ruptura del filtro es real.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       label: "Completa" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "3b · E2B",
    en: { name: "E2B complete (100 × 7 × 2)",   desc: "14 cells, 1,400 inferences, judging and mechanistic. Base→abliterated gap +39 points uniform across the 7 languages. Mean abliterated compliance 42.9%. Took 5h 47m on the laptop.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              label: "Done · May 3, 2026" },
    es: { name: "E2B completa (100 × 7 × 2)",   desc: "14 celdas, 1.400 inferencias, judging y mecanística. Gap base→abliterado +39 puntos uniforme en los 7 idiomas. Compliance abliterada media 42.9%. Tomó 5h 47m en la laptop.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     label: "Completa · 3 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "4",
    en: { name: "31B in the cloud · inference + judging", desc: "Gemma 4 31B Dense on RunPod RTX 5090 (Norway). Base inference 6h 10m, abliterated 13h 42m, judging 27 min. Mean abliterated compliance 64.4% (vs 42.9% on E2B). Cost ~$23.50. Mechanistic abandoned due to degraded GPU.",                                                                                                                                                                                label: "Done · May 4, 2026" },
    es: { name: "31B en la nube · inferencia + judging",   desc: "Gemma 4 31B Dense en RunPod RTX 5090 (Noruega). Inferencia base 6h 10m, abliterated 13h 42m, judging 27 min. Compliance abliterada media 64.4% (vs 42.9% en E2B). Costó ~$23.50. Mecanística abandonada por GPU degradada.",                                                                                                                                                                              label: "Completa · 4 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "3b · E4B",
    en: { name: "E4B in the cloud · inference + judging",  desc: "Had to move to RunPod because the laptop OOMed loading 4-bit weights (peak >8GB on RTX 4070). On RunPod RTX 5090 it ran 7h 1m, $7.33. Mean abliterated compliance 68.1%, the peak of the curve, beats 31B. Mechanistic deferred from this run and completed later on a fresh pod on May 6 (see phase 5c).",                                                                                              label: "Done · May 5, 2026" },
    es: { name: "E4B en la nube · inferencia + judging",   desc: "Tuvo que mudarse a RunPod porque la laptop OOMeó al cargar pesos en 4-bit (peak >8GB en RTX 4070). En RunPod RTX 5090 corrió 7h 1m, $7.33. Compliance abliterada media 68.1%, el pico de la curva, supera a 31B. Mecanística diferida en este run y completada después en una pod fresca el 6 May (ver fase 5c).",                                                                                       label: "Completa · 5 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "5a",
    en: { name: "Mechanistic E2B",          desc: "Refusal directions + Silhouette + PCA on E2B. Done within the May 3 run.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          label: "Done · May 3, 2026" },
    es: { name: "Mecanística E2B",          desc: "Refusal directions + Silhouette + PCA en E2B. Listo dentro del run del 3 May.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     label: "Completa · 3 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "5b",
    en: { name: "Mechanistic 31B",          desc: "Ran on a fresh RunPod RTX 5090 pod on May 6, separated from the 31B inference run to avoid the original NVML degradation. 30 min wall, $0.40. Self-terminated via GraphQL. Result: cross-lingual cosine sim mean 0.27 (the lowest of the trio), Silhouette mean 0.23.",                                                                                                                                                  label: "Done · May 6, 2026" },
    es: { name: "Mecanística 31B",          desc: "Corrió en una pod RunPod RTX 5090 fresca el 6 May, separada del run de inferencia para evitar la degradación de NVML del 31B original. 30 min wall, $0.40. Self-terminate por GraphQL. Resultado: cosine sim cross-lingual mean 0.27 (la más baja del trío), Silhouette mean 0.23.",                                                                                                                                    label: "Completa · 6 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "5c",
    en: { name: "Mechanistic E4B",          desc: "Ran in parallel to the 31B mechanistic, fresh pod, 12 min wall, $0.30. Result: cross-lingual cosine sim mean 0.37 (the highest of the trio, peak at E4B aligning with the compliance peak), Silhouette mean 0.26.",                                                                                                                                                                                                    label: "Done · May 6, 2026" },
    es: { name: "Mecanística E4B",          desc: "Corrió en paralelo a la del 31B, pod fresca, 12 min wall, $0.30. Resultado: cosine sim cross-lingual mean 0.37 (la más alta del trío, pico en E4B coincidiendo con el pico de compliance), Silhouette mean 0.26.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      label: "Completa · 6 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "6",
    en: { name: "Cross-size analysis",      desc: "Cross-size figures regenerated with scripts/06_visualize.py: base/abl/delta compliance heatmaps, size_vs_compliance (the non-monotonic curve peaking at E4B), silhouette_by_size. Refusal direction cosine sim also peaks at E4B, confirming Mechanism #1 of the blog post Discussion.",                                                                                                                                  label: "Done · May 6, 2026" },
    es: { name: "Análisis estadístico cruzado", desc: "Figuras cross-size regeneradas con scripts/06_visualize.py: compliance heatmaps base/abl/delta, size_vs_compliance (la curva no monótona con pico en E4B), silhouette_by_size. La cosine sim de refusal directions también pica en E4B, confirmando el Mechanism #1 del Discussion del blog post.",                                                                                                                 label: "Completa · 6 May 2026" },
    status: "done",
  },
  {
    id: "7",
    en: { name: "Paper",                    desc: "Writing, figures, review, submission. Headline finding closed: the size→post-abliteration curve is non-monotonic with peak at E4B; cross-lingual cosine sim of refusal directions also peaks at E4B; the compliance peak and the geometry peak coincide.",                                                                                                                                                            label: "Next step" },
    es: { name: "Paper",                    desc: "Redacción, figuras, revisión, submission. Headline finding cerrado: la curva tamaño→post-abliteración es no monótona con pico en E4B; la cosine sim cross-lingual de las refusal directions también pica en E4B; el pico de compliance y el pico de geometría coinciden.",                                                                                                                                              label: "Próximo paso" },
    status: "next",
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="timeline">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="section-number">
      <span data-lang="en">09 — Status</span>
      <span data-lang="es">09 — Estado</span>
    </div>
    <h2>
      <span data-lang="en">Where we are</span>
      <span data-lang="es">En qué punto estamos</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="lead" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
      <span data-lang="en">
        As of May 6, 2026: all three sizes are closed across inference, judging
        and mechanistic (refusal directions + Silhouette + PCA). E2B local, E4B and 31B on
        RunPod for inference, two additional fresh pods (~$0.70 combined) for the
        mechanistic. Cross-lingual cosine similarity of refusal directions also peaks at E4B
        (mean 0.37 vs 0.31 E2B and 0.27 31B): the compliance peak and the geometry peak
        coincide. Next step: drafting the paper.
      </span>
      <span data-lang="es">
        Al 6 de mayo de 2026: los tres tamaños están cerrados en inferencia, judging
        y mecanística (refusal directions + Silhouette + PCA). E2B local, E4B y 31B en
        RunPod para inferencia, dos pods fresh adicionales (~$0.70 combinados) para la
        mecanística. La cosine similarity cross-lingual de las refusal directions
        también pica en E4B (mean 0.37 vs 0.31 E2B y 0.27 31B): el pico de compliance
        y el pico de geometría coinciden. Próximo paso: redactar el paper.
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="timeline" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
      {phases.map((p) => (
        <div class={`timeline__phase timeline__phase--${p.status}`}>
          <div class="timeline__phase-name">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--amber-500); margin-right: var(--space-3);">
              <span data-lang="en">Phase {p.id}</span>
              <span data-lang="es">Fase {p.id}</span>
            </span>
            <span data-lang="en">{p.en.name}</span>
            <span data-lang="es">{p.es.name}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__phase-desc">
            <span data-lang="en">{p.en.desc}</span>
            <span data-lang="es">{p.es.desc}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__phase-status">
            <span data-lang="en">{p.en.label}</span>
            <span data-lang="es">{p.es.label}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
